{"id": "EUVD-2026-35164", "enisaUuid": "9edf2d95-66ae-3a5d-b60f-a27ef20d66c3", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\npseries/papr-hvpipe: Fix race with interrupt handler\n\nWhile executing ->ioctl handler or ->release handler, if an interrupt\nfires on the same cpu, then we can enter into a deadlock.\n\nThis patch fixes both these handlers to take spin_lock_irq{save|restore}\nversions of the lock to prevent this deadlock.", "datePublished": "2026-06-08T15:46:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T10:07:28", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b33d6f5da16e0eec95b933342812c689cdfcec03", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/342c966f81cfc3cb6c297e80b37a9f3a5d637d2c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a4f0846ee6cc8cf44ae0046ed42e3259d1dd45b"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qppg-32m7-mvgc", "CVE-2026-46298"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "101c5d0f-7e2c-3965-ad8a-196d77cf9fd5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "814ef095f12c9fa142043ee689500f3a41bb6dab <342c966f81cfc3cb6c297e80b37a9f3a5d637d2c"}, {"id": "3e9f1547-b852-32dc-85b4-2954f0453d7b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "62d261a1-ce95-3d0b-b70a-01d971c154ae", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "814ef095f12c9fa142043ee689500f3a41bb6dab <b33d6f5da16e0eec95b933342812c689cdfcec03"}, {"id": "864166d2-84ca-34f8-81a9-8ed6ba99d0b0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "814ef095f12c9fa142043ee689500f3a41bb6dab <7a4f0846ee6cc8cf44ae0046ed42e3259d1dd45b"}, {"id": "d190abd5-9ee0-34ef-bd68-7252662da1b0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e6667fbd-62a3-3977-95ec-f19504de3a75", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1"}, {"id": "e72dffff-